  lab:{t:'Activity: Compare and simulate a safe purchase (no real payment)', steps:['Choose one product (e.g., a USB flash drive) and find it on two platforms (e.g., Daraz and Telemart/Shophive).','Compare price, delivery fee, seller rating, number of reviews, return policy, warranty.','Identify one red flag in any listing.','Simulate checkout up to the payment page only — do NOT place an order.','Write your decision and three reasons.'], out:'Comparison table + decision.'},
  disc:['Why do people buy things they don\'t need during online sales? (Think of scarcity, social proof.)','Are online reviews trustworthy? How can they be manipulated?','What should a buyer do if a seller refuses a valid return?'],
